      "id": "2026-11-21-field-fields-that-one-role-2a0713b6",
      "kind": "new",
      "summary": "Add `FieldKit`, which installs `FieldPlugin` with `FieldElement`. The chip shows a field's label, an asterisk when it is required, its role, and a warning when `useFieldRead` reports a problem, such as a condition whose field was deleted. A click opens a popover for the field's label, kind, role, required flag, default, choice options and a Show when condition on another field. The role input offers the roles the document's fields already use. Installing `field` also installs `field-toolbar-button`.",
